---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "Brain Industries (Pty) Ltd, Pretoria — electrical and hazardous area (Ex) specialists. Hazardous area classification, electrical and earthing audits, installations, certificates of compliance and Ex product supply."
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Electrical · Hazardous areas · Ex products</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Quality electrical services &amp; products for <em>industrial and hazardous</em> environments</h1>
      <p class="lead">Brain Industries is an electrical company specialising in hazardous area (Ex) services and product supply. From area classification and audits to installation, certification and digital inspections — backed by more than 20 years of experience.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services/">Explore our services {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ site.documents.companyProfile.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "file-down" %} Company profile <span class="visually-hidden">(PDF)</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-sub muted">New: <a class="link-arrow" href="/inspectx/">Discover InspectX, our QR-code-driven inspection system {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-media">
      {% image "/assets/images/gallery/panel-line-up.jpg", "Line-up of orange industrial electrical panels in a plant room", "(min-width: 60em) 460px, 100vw", "eager" %}
      <p class="hero-tag"><strong>Pretoria, South Africa</strong><span>Electrical &amp; Ex specialists</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="facts" aria-label="Key facts">
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="facts-list">
      <li class="fact">{% icon "badge-check" %}<div><strong>20+ years</strong><span>of electrical and hazardous area experience</span></div></li>
      <li class="fact">{% icon "hard-hat" %}<div><strong>Qualified M.I.E</strong><span>Master Installation Electrician</span></div></li>
      <li class="fact">{% icon "shield-check" %}<div><strong>Ex specialists</strong><span>Classification, installation, inspection and supply</span></div></li>
      <li class="fact">{% icon "globe" %}<div><strong>Global experience</strong><span>Completed projects for industry-leading clients</span></div></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">01</span> What we do</p>
        <h2 id="services-title">Services and products for electrical and Ex installations</h2>
      </div>
      <p>We work across the life of an installation — establishing where the hazards are, supplying and installing the right equipment, and verifying that it remains safe and compliant.</p>
    </div>

    <h3 class="group-label">Services</h3>
    <ul class="card-grid" data-reveal>
      {%- for s in services | byGroup("service") %}
      <li class="card">
        <span class="card-index">{{ loop.index | pad }}</span>
        <span class="card-icon">{% icon s.icon %}</span>
        <h3><a href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ s.short }}</p>
        <span class="link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">Learn more {% icon "arrow-right" %}</span>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <h3 class="group-label">Products</h3>
    <ul class="card-grid" data-reveal>
      {%- for s in services | byGroup("product") %}
      <li class="card">
        <span class="card-index">{{ loop.index | pad }}</span>
        <span class="card-icon">{% icon s.icon %}</span>
        <h3><a href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ s.short }}</p>
        <span class="link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">Learn more {% icon "arrow-right" %}</span>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-paper section-line" aria-labelledby="lifecycle-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">02</span> How we help</p>
        <h2 id="lifecycle-title">One partner across the hazardous area lifecycle</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Safety in a hazardous location depends on every step being done correctly. Because we work across all of them, nothing gets lost between classification, equipment, installation and inspection.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="lifecycle" data-reveal>
      <li><h3>Classify</h3><p>Identify where explosive atmospheres can occur and define the zones.</p><a href="/services/hazardous-area-classification/">Area classification</a></li>
      <li><h3>Specify &amp; supply</h3><p>Select and supply equipment suited to the zone, group and temperature class.</p><a href="/services/explosion-protected-equipment/">Ex equipment</a></li>
      <li><h3>Install</h3><p>Install equipment so that its protection concept is maintained.</p><a href="/services/hazardous-area-installations/">Installations</a></li>
      <li><h3>Inspect &amp; certify</h3><p>Audit electrical and earthing systems and certify compliance.</p><a href="/services/electrical-earthing-audits/">Audits</a> · <a href="/services/certificate-of-compliance/">CoC</a></li>
      <li class="is-digital"><h3>Digitise</h3><p>Record ongoing inspections digitally, with QR codes and photo verification.</p><a href="/inspectx/">InspectX</a></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark qr-texture" aria-labelledby="ix-title">
  <div class="container ix-band-grid">
    <div>
      <img class="ix-logo" src="/assets/images/brand/inspectx-logo-white.png" alt="InspectX" width="1069" height="625" loading="lazy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">03</span> Digital inspections</p>
      <h2 id="ix-title">Lose the paperwork. Inspect with a scan.</h2>
      <p class="lead">InspectX is a web-based, QR-code-driven inspection platform for hazardous and industrial environments. Inspectors scan the equipment, follow guided checks and capture photo evidence — managers see results, defects and compliance status in one portal.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="/inspectx/">Discover InspectX {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="{{ site.documents.inspectxOnePager.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "file-down" %} One-pager <span class="visually-hidden">(PDF)</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="ix-feature-list" data-reveal>
      <li>{% icon "qr-code" %}<div><strong>QR codes &amp; photo verification</strong><span>On-site proof and instant retrieval of equipment information.</span></div></li>
      <li>{% icon "clipboard-check" %}<div><strong>Visual, close &amp; detailed inspections</strong><span>Structured checks aligned with periodic Ex inspection requirements.</span></div></li>
      <li>{% icon "chart-column" %}<div><strong>Management reporting</strong><span>Real-time results, defect tracking and reports by site, date or equipment.</span></div></li>
      <li>{% icon "users" %}<div><strong>Multiple users in the field</strong><span>Several devices can capture inspections simultaneously.</span></div></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container split wide-left">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">04</span> About us</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">Electrical expertise with a hazardous area focus</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>We are an electrical company specialising in electrical and hazardous area services and product supply. We take pride in quality, professional service delivery for all of your electrical and Ex requirements.</p>
        <p>Our work is led by a qualified M.I.E with more than 20 years of experience, and our experience extends across the globe — with many completed projects for clients who are leaders in their industries.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/about/">More about Brain Industries {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="panel" data-reveal>
      <div class="panel-head">Company at a glance</div>
      <div class="panel-body">
        <dl class="spec">
          <dt>Company</dt><dd>{{ site.legalName }}</dd>
          <dt>Based in</dt><dd>{{ site.address.suburb }}, {{ site.address.city }}</dd>
          <dt>Focus</dt><dd>Electrical &amp; hazardous area (Ex) services and products</dd>
          <dt>Experience</dt><dd>20+ years</dd>
          <dt>Qualification</dt><dd>M.I.E (Master Installation Electrician)</dd>
          <dt>Digital product</dt><dd>InspectX inspection system</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-paper section-line" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">05</span> Projects</p>
        <h2 id="projects-title">Recent work and products</h2>
      </div>
      <p>A selection of control stations, panels, installations and products from our work. <a href="/projects/">View the full gallery</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="gallery gallery-preview" data-reveal>
      {%- set picks = [gallery.items[0], gallery.items[2], gallery.items[5], gallery.items[10]] %}
      {%- for item in picks %}
      <li>
        <figure>
          <a href="/projects/">{% image item.src, item.alt, "(min-width: 48em) 25vw, 50vw" %}</a>
          <figcaption>{{ item.caption }}</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
